  displayName: Dracolich
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1d639387a517c444f9cd0a24b74ac8a4, type: 3}
  description: Dracoliches are undeads, sometimes mistaken for dragonkin, massive
    like dragons but reduced to bone and tattered hide, with a skeletal tail and
    great skeletal wings that still carry them aloft with necromantic magic. On the
    ground they move with a slow, deliberate draconic stride, more inexorable than
    agile. They are hauntingly silent - no living roar, just the whistle of wind
    through bones and the grinding of ancient joints.
